=Sensitivity tends to rise and specificity tends to fall#Correct.
~Both always rise#Review which population is in the denominator and what the test comparison represents.
~Sensitivity falls and specificity rises#Review which population is in the denominator and what the test comparison represents.
~Neither can change#Review which population is in the denominator and what the test comparison represents.
}

