=AUC summarises discrimination across thresholds but does not by itself determine clinical usefulness or PPV#Correct.
~AUC equals PPV#AUC is a discrimination summary, not a complete decision metric.
~AUC identifies the universally optimal threshold#AUC is a discrimination summary, not a complete decision metric.
~AUC proves the reference standard is correct#AUC is a discrimination summary, not a complete decision metric.
}

